OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for urgent river safety
OL,4,Ameasures
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has called for urgent safety
OL,7,Fmeasures at York's River Ouse following
OL,8,Fa series of incidents on one of its
OL,9,Fbridges.
OL,11,FYork Central MP Rachael Maskell said
OL,12,Fshe was "frustrated" over the slow pace
OL,13,Fof improving safety along the waterway,
OL,14,Fwhich runs through the city centre.
OL,16,FIt comes after Ouse Bridge was closed
OL,17,Ftwice within three days due to
OL,18,Femergencies at the start of the month.
OL,20,FThe politician called for improved
OL,21,Flighting and more CCTV along the
OL,22,Friverside.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
